      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00585",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我已经想不起来多少年没打过人了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I can no longer remember how many years it has been since I last struck anyone.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00585",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "这回多蒙你原谅。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Please forgive me this time.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00585",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不过，秀男，我还想问问你，当你看到我的腰带图案时，为什么显得那样古怪。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But Hideo, I still want to ask you why you looked so strange when you saw the pattern on my sash.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00585",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你能不能跟我直言？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Can you tell me frankly?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
